WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:02.869
-Every time we talk, I just love
hearing stories about you.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.804
I love your opinion on
different things.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.139
And I thought we could maybe do
something different this time.

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:10.076
I wanted to play a game with you
called "Wheel of Opinions."

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.477
Are you down with this?
-I'm so ready.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.913
I'm so excited to play a game.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:15.748
-Yeah. I love it.
Okay, here we go.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:18.117
Let's -- I want your opinion.
Let's see what happening.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:21.954
[ Beeping ]
Ooh!

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.623
Alright, this is it.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:24.723
I want to hear your opinion.

00:00:24.723 --> 00:00:26.893
Throw pillows --
what do you think?

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.828
-Too many to get comfortable.
-Yes.

00:00:29.828 --> 00:00:32.832
-You can never use
one throw pillow

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.300
to really get comfortable
on a couch.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.203
You know, being short,

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:40.906
there's so much space
between me and the back,

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:43.642
I need about
four of those throw pillows

00:00:43.642 --> 00:00:45.445
in order to look like an adult.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:50.183
-[ Laughs ]
Oh, that's interesting.

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:53.819
Okay, here we go.
Let's try another weird opinion.

00:00:53.819 --> 00:00:56.122
What's your opinion on...

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.726
Oh. Bite or lick your ice cream?

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:02.227
-Okay, I say both.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:04.297
You start with a lick.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.233
You end up when you get down to
the cone with a bite.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.101
-Yeah, that's correct,
how you do it!

00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:11.770
I forgot you do bite the cone.
You have to bite the cone.

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:14.440
-Have to bite the cone
to get to the ice cream

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.743
that has melted
into the core of the cone.

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.479
-Yes, that is a reward.
I totally forgot about that.

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:22.482
Alright, let's do one more here.
Here we go.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.050
Final topic is...
[ Beeping ]

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:32.992
Well, this is going to be
controversial.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.061
Henry, this is
better BTS song --

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:38.831
"Butter," their new song,
or "Dynamite"?

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:45.805
-Okay, okay, so, I like when
all of them sing together.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.806
And they sound really good.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.642
There are about 150 of them.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:53.145
They -- Really.

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:59.486
And they make the sound of
butter delicious.

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:01.387
So I'm going to go with
"Dynamite."

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.023
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.691
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:05.691 --> 00:02:08.561
That's why we love you.
Henry Winkler, everybody!

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:12.065
"Monsters at Work" premieres
July 7th on Disney+.

